      examples: ["I've had a voice assistant for six months. = Tenho um assistente de voz há seis meses.", "I had a voice assistant for six months. = Tive um assistente de voz por seis meses (não tenho mais).", "My father has lived with us since 2020. = Meu pai mora conosco desde 2020."],
